# Operator-local deny-list for check_public_clean.sh — NEVER commit the real file.
# One credential literal per line. '#' comments and blank lines ignored.
#
# Purpose: gitleaks scores by entropy and cannot catch a weak human-chosen password.
# Put every known-real fleet credential here so the publish gate greps history for it.
# Rotate the credential FIRST; scrubbing history while it still works protects nothing.
#
# example-only, not a real credential:
# hunter2
